. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. * Colors, one per state, from the palette used in the brief
. *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. local palette `" "42 120 214" "235 104 52" "27 175 122" "237 161 0" "232 123 164" "74 58 167" "0 131 0" "'

